# Rebuild the app bundle

After changing Swift sources, bundled plugins, or anything that ships inside `Summon.app`, run `Scripts/build-app.sh` before finishing. Do not only leave source-tree changes.

If `dist/Summon.app` is running, quit it, rebuild, then open the new bundle so the running app matches the tree.
